  (text
    "bzzy LED ring: 16 x WS2812B-2020 around the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.69"
    (at 25 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 73962e71-b684-4f80-adbb-17ecb0effa05))
  (text
    "J1 is three wire holes (5V, GND, GPIO17) and J2 one more (GPIO18, top button). Wire them to the Waveshare board's pads."
    (at 25 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 44ad0710-d0d1-4fb2-8f22-eadd2de0423b))
  (text
    "U1 lifts the 3.3 V data to 5 V logic. R1 keeps the line low while the ESP32 boots."
    (at 25 45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 614ac123-3783-465e-9380-19db6c79a483))
  (text
    "LED chain: D1 (bottom-left) runs clockwise to D16. TP1 is the chain's DOUT, for adding more LEDs later."
    (at 25 108 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 830abb9d-5030-4e2a-a856-3a2e60298191))
